      "message": "[error] Line 125: 🔴 This signal combines both `closed_by_host` and `closed_by_peer` in `CallbacksHandler`, but `requestKept\u003dtrue` assumes the daemon still owns the request. `closed_by_host` is a terminal local-host cancellation, so a sync transfer that reaches this path can be moved to `pending_` with no future completion event and keep the conversation in attachment sync forever. Preserve the event distinction (or split the callbacks) and only suspend when the daemon explicitly retains the request.",
