      "message": "[error] Line 226: 🔴 `timeout_expired` and `unjoinable_peer` are terminal transfer errors, not retained requests. Moving them to `pending_` leaves the attachment permanently pending because the daemon has already abandoned the transfer; `hasWork()` then keeps auto-accept disabled indefinitely. Call the terminal/finish path for these statuses and reserve suspension for a confirmed peer-loss retry state.",
